<title>JAPAN: Rokko Butter - 1996 parent results.</title>
<headline>Rokko Butter - 1996 parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-02-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to December 31, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
