<p> EPS	     loss 7.47 yen	  vs     prft 3.51 yen</p>
<p> Diluted EPS	     -		vs		 -</p>
<p> Shares	     21 million	  vs	  20 million</p>
<p> Ord div		7.50 yen	  vs	    7.50 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Rokko Butter Co Ltd is a major cheese manufacturer.</p>
